e": "describer", "content": "Imperatives are commands or instructions. You do not use the subject with the verb. When you are learning something new, you hear many Imperatives.    <br/>Here are some Imperatives you hear when are learning to ski: "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Imperative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"fasten\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Fasten the ski boots tightly.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"put on\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Put on the skis carefully.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"don't forget\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Don't forget to put on goggles and gloves.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"watch out\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Oops! Watch out, people below!\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"use\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Use your poles to keep your balance.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Prepositions of Place"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Prepositions of place help explain where something is located.  "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Preposition\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Phrase\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"on\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"touching the surface\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"on the ground\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"below, under\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"something is closer to the ground than other thing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"under your seat\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"in\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"within an enclosed space<br/>in a country\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"in the overhead compartment <br/>in Canada\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"above\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"on top of something but not touching it\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"above your head\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"around\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"going in a circle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"around your waist\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Archeologists found very old skis on mountains in Sweden and Finland. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Watch out, people below me! "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm above you and I can't stop!"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to fasten"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to attach; to put together"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Fasten your ski boots tightly."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob11aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you need to review."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to focus on"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to concentrate on; to put an emphasis on"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My lesson focused on the basics. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob11aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "goggles"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "glasses for skiing"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need to buy a pair of goggles to go skiing."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob11aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "gloves"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "used to protect your hands from the cold"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's cold. You need your gloves."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob11aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "skis"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "long thin boards used for skiing"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am going to rent skis."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob11aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pole"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a stick used for skiing"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(nouns)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Can I use your poles today?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le04ob11aud06"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le04ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Decide which destination you want to blog about, following Sally's example."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Start with an introduction."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 30 - 50 words."}, {"type": "text", "content": "End with a conclusion."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your blog to a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a blog about a holiday destination."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I begin the blog with an introd